  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;text-align:center;visibility:visible;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-6/202276163477767.jpg\" alt=\"1\" title=\"1\" /><br /><br /><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-6/202276163475098.jpg\" alt=\"2\" title=\"2\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;line-height:1.7;visibility:visible;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">古河云科技成立于2017年，是国内领先的数字化转型行业级一体化解决方案服务商，能够为客户提供从基础建造、日常运维到深度运营的一体化、全生命周期数字化转型解决方案。公司自成立以来，始终坚持自主创新，具备完善的自主知识产权体系，为客户数字化转型提供稳定、可靠的技术保障，助力产业转型升级。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;line-height:1.7;visibility:visible;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">历经五年的快速发展，古河云科技服务客户超百个，落地项目多达150余个，通过众多项目积累和技术沉淀，公司从自身及客户进行深入分析，其中客户层面，去烟囱化，解决独立单点系统建设；去孤岛化，解决数据孤岛问题以及平台整合，对现有系统进行接入与整合，成为普遍存在的需求，而公司层面需要减少重复建设，沉淀共性能力，快速拓展业务；将行业数据、技术能力转化为可量化的无形资产，支撑整体业务发展，是公司持续稳步发展必须解决的问题。基于内外部的诸多需求，<span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#008fdb;visibility:visible;\">古河云“开河”数字化云支撑平台</span>应运而生。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;text-indent:0em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">古河云“开河”数字化云支撑平台，以中台化思想、云架构理念为核心，依托物联网、数字孪生、云计算、AI等前沿科技技术。支持多维度、轻量化的可视化建模，多协议接口、多终端的智能物联，实现快速产品衍生、快速定制、高效部署，有效解决客户多系统、数据孤岛以及重复建设等问题。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;text-indent:0em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\"><section style=\"margin:20px 0px 10px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;text-align:center;justify-content:center;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;visibility:visible;\"><section style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-width:0px 1px 1px 0px;border-color:#3e3e3e #9e9e9e #9e9e9e #3e3e3e;min-width:10%;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;align-self:flex-start;visibility:visible;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\"><section style=\"margin:-3px 0px 2px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;justify-content:center;transform:translate3d(-4px, 0px, 0px);display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;visibility:visible;\"><section style=\"margin:-3px 0px 2px;padding:7px 12px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:inline-block;width:106.181px;vertical-align:top;border-style:solid;border-width:1px;border-color:#9e9e9e;flex:0 0 auto;height:auto;background-color:#008fdb;align-self:flex-start;visibility:visible;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;font-size:18px;color:#ffffff;text-align:justify;visibility:visible;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\">平台架构</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;text-align:center;visibility:visible;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-6/202276163483228.png\" alt=\"3\" title=\"3\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;visibility:visible;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;visibility:visible;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">“开河”数字化云支撑平台围绕三方软硬件标准化、通用性整合进行构建，支撑多种智能硬件与业务软件的集成，致力于将硬件和应用解耦，让更多的设备连接进来，从而赋予平台更强的业务支撑能力；并通过不同的业务应用，进行灵活组合，形成面对不同场景的特定产品线/产品，在实现总体能力的前提下，大幅提升子业务场景各项功能的稳定性与可靠性。最后基于产品或产品线能力，进行行业平台级或纵深业务级产品整合，并针对客户痛点，形成满足业务需求的解决方案矩阵，以应对不同的客户市场，真正做到通过技术创新，反哺客户业务。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2022-7-6/202276163484256.png\" alt=\"4\" title=\"4\" /><br /><br /><br /></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><section style=\"margin:20px 0px 10px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;text-align:center;justify-content:center;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-a