0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;line-height:1.7;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">开河数字化云支撑平台引入物联网、大数据、云计算、人工智能、区块链、三维可视化等主流前沿技术，围绕集成接入、技术支撑、业务应用、产品矩阵、解决方案等五大维度进行产品技术整合，构建起一套能够融合各类三方软硬件系统并且适用于全业务应用场景的数字化底层支撑平台。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;text-indent:0em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><section style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 11px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:inline-block;width:661.024px;vertical-align:top;border-left:3px solid #0391e3;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;color:#0391e3;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\">物联网技术应用</strong></p></section></section></section></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;line-height:1.7;\"><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;text-indent:0em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\">平台整合了各类主流厂商常见接口，实现了各类设备的快速接入，已拥有100多种协议插件，基本具备市面上90%的系统协议对接能力。可以实现针对不同场景，不同环境下的业务数据采集，通过物联网数据集成，实现平台数据沉淀。</p><p style=\"padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;min-height:1em;text-indent:0em;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;\"><br style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\" /></p></section><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;\"><section style=\"margin:10px 0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;justify-content:flex-start;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px 0px 0px 11px;outline:0px;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;display:inline-block;width:661.024px;vertical-align:top;border-left:3px solid #0391e3;border-bottom-left-radius:0px;align-self:flex-start;flex:0 0 auto;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;outline:0px;max